/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 89 0 R
/E (In Apex Legends, players work together as a squad to survive and become the last team standing. Each player chooses a Legend with unique abilities and explores the map to collect weapons, armor, and healing items while fighting enemy squads. The game can be played using a keyboard and mouse on PC or a controller on consoles. The main gameplay focuses on teamwork, combat, and using each Legend's abilities strategically. Players can revive teammates, use Respawn Beacons, and move around the map through sliding, climbing, and zip lines. A match is won when the squad is the last one remaining, while it is lost when all teammates are eliminated and cannot be revived. As the match progresses, the safe zone shrinks, making battles more intense and requiring players to adapt their strategies to survive.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
